{
  "name": "dsh-resume-on-restart",
  "version": "0.8.0",
  "description": "DSH 插件：检测 DSH 服务重启后自动恢复重启前活跃的全部会话（依赖 Host sessionController，缺失时降级为通知主会话），让中断的工作自动继续。带重启日志（restarts.ndjson，设置弹窗只读展示）、web 会话顶栏开关（按会话排除自动恢复）与重启引擎（设置弹窗「重启」按钮二次确认 + /restart 命令 + restart_harness 模型工具；helper 握手拉起，容器 PID=1 走优雅退出交由容器重启策略）。仅依赖 cordis ctx 服务，兼容 DSH Desktop 打包环境。",
  "keywords": [
    "dsh",
    "dsh-plugin",
    "deepseek-harness",
    "restart",
    "resume",
    "wake",
    "client-plugin",
    "cordis"
  ],
  "type": "module",
  "main": "lib/index.js",
  "exports": {
    ".": "./lib/index.js",
    "./client": "./lib/client.js",
    "./package.json": "./package.json"
  },
  "files": [
    "lib",
    "cordis.patch.yml"
  ],
  "dsh": {
    "bundle": {
      "patch": "./cordis.patch.yml"
    },
    "client": {
      "platform": "web"
    }
  },
  "scripts": {
    "test": "node --test lib/detect.test.js lib/session-scan.test.js lib/restart.test.js"
  },
  "engines": {
    "node": ">=18"
  },
  "repository": {
    "type": "git",
    "url": "git+https://github.com/nickkkkkk123123/dsh-resume-on-restart.git"
  },
  "license": "MIT",
  "peerDependencies": {
    "@deepseek-ai/cordis": "^4.0.1"
  }
}
